{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, responsive Shopify pricing section that closely matches the attached reference. Use the reference as the primary guide for layout, spacing, typography, colors, and proportions.

    SECTION LAYOUT
    - White background with a centered container, approximately 1240px maximum width.
    - Generous whitespace and around 60px vertical padding.
    - Small uppercase navy eyebrow with a tiny blue dot: “SHOPIFY WEBSITE PACKAGES”.
    - Large, left-aligned heading on two lines:
      “Your next chapter.”
      “Built on Shopify.”
    - First line: dark charcoal, regular weight.
    - Second line: orange, italic, regular weight.
    - Desktop heading approximately 64px; mobile approximately 38px.
    - Thin light-gray horizontal divider below the heading.
    - Below the divider, place a small pale blue-gray pill on the left reading “One-time project pricing”.
    - On the right, show small muted text: “All prices in USD · No monthly agency commitment”.

    PRICING CARDS
    Create three equal-width cards in a desktop grid, with 16px gaps and equal heights. Use subtle borders, 8px corner radii, approximately 28px internal padding, and no shadows.

    LEFT CARD
    - Very light gray background and dark text.
    - Small navy uppercase label: “01 / START STRONG”.
    - Title: “Launch”.
    - Description: “A professional first store, without the complexity.”
    - Large price: “$1,000”.
    - Small text below: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Full-width white button with a thin dark border, text “Choose Launch”, and a small diagonal up-right arrow at the far right.
    - Thin divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “YOUR LAUNCH ESSENTIALS”.
    - Feature list with small blue checkmarks:
      Premium theme installed & branded
      Up to 25 products loaded
      Home, About, Contact + 1 policy page
      Payments, shipping, taxes & domain
      1 app installed & configured
      Basic SEO & notification emails
      Mobile responsiveness check
      Recorded training walkthrough
      1 revision round · 7 days of support
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 1–2 weeks”.

    CENTER CARD
    - Deep charcoal-green background, approximately #1F251E, with white text.
    - Small orange uppercase label: “02 / BUILD MOMENTUM”.
    - Orange pill badge at the upper right reading “THE GROWTH PICK”.
    - Title: “Growth”.
    - Description: “A tailored store for brands ready to go further.”
    - Large price: “$3,000”.
    - Small muted text: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Full-width orange button, approximately #FF7414, with dark text “Choose Growth” and a diagonal up-right arrow aligned right.
    - Subtle divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “A MORE TAILORED FOUNDATION”.
    - Feature list with orange checkmarks:
      30-minute strategy call
      Tailored home, collection & product templates
      Up to 150 products · up to 8 pages
      Full setup, discounts & market settings
      Up to 3 apps installed & configured
      Klaviyo welcome & abandoned cart flows
      On-page SEO, redirects & sitemap
      Basic product & customer migration
      Mobile & speed optimization
      Recorded training · 2 revision rounds
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 3–5 weeks”.

    RIGHT CARD
    - Match the left card’s light-gray styling.
    - Small navy uppercase label: “03 / THINK BIGGER”.
    - Title: “Scale”.
    - Description: “A bespoke experience for your next stage of growth.”
    - Large price: “$10,000”.
    - Small text: “USD · One-time investment”.
    - Outlined white button: “Choose Scale”, with a diagonal up-right arrow aligned right.
    - Thin divider.
    - Small bold uppercase heading: “A FULLY CUSTOM FOUNDATION”.
    - Feature list with small blue checkmarks:
      Discovery & competitor review
      Custom wireframes, UI & bespoke sections
      Unlimited bulk product import · 20+ pages
      Multi-market & advanced store setup
      Up to 8 apps + custom integrations
      Full Klaviyo flows, analytics & tracking
      Technical SEO, schema & redirect mapping
      Product, customer & order migration
      Performance tuning & CRO review
      Training · 3 revision rounds
      Dedicated PM · 60 days of support
    - Bold footer pinned near the bottom: “Estimated delivery: 8–12 weeks”.

    BOTTOM NOTE
    Centered beneath the cards in small muted gray text:
    “Shopify subscriptions, paid themes, and third-party app charges should be confirmed separately before your project begins.”

    DESIGN DETAILS
    - Use a clean sans-serif font and regular-weight headings.
    - Keep descriptions and features compact with comfortable line spacing.
    - Align titles, prices, buttons, dividers, and bottom delivery text consistently across cards.
    - Use flex layouts inside cards so delivery text stays aligned at the bottom despite different feature counts.
    - Keep the center card the same size and vertical position as the others.
    - Do not add images, gradients, decorative graphics, animations, or hover movement.

    MOBILE
    - Stack cards vertically in this order: Launch, Growth, Scale.
    - Use 20px side gutters and prevent horizontal overflow.
    - Allow the pricing pill and currency note to stack neatly.
    - Keep buttons full width and all text readable.

    SHOPIFY EDITOR SETTINGS
    - Make sectio
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #252923;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, Arial, sans-serif);
  }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before, .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #173653; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; flex: 0 0 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3184c6; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin: 0; color: #252923; font-family: var(--font-heading-family, Arial, sans-serif); font-size: clamp(38px, 5.2vw, 64px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading em { display: block; color: #f36f19; font-weight: 400; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rule { height: 1px; margin: 30px 0 20px; border: 0; background: #d9dddc; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill { padding: 8px 13px; border-radius: 999px; background: #edf2f4; color: #35464f; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__currency { margin: 0; color: #657078; font-size: 12px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); align-items: stretch; gap: 16px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; padding: 27px; border: 1px solid #dfe2df; border-radius: 8px; background: #f6f7f5; color: #252923; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured { border-color: #1f251e; background: #1f251e; color: #ffffff; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 19px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number { margin: 0; color: #173653; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number { color: #ff8a3d; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { padding: 6px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ff7414; color: #251b12; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .07em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { min-height: 40px; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #59615d; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { color: #c8cfca; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { margin: 0; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-note { margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #68716d; font-size: 11px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-note { color: #c0c8c2; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; width: 100%; min-height: 46px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #414943; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff; color: #252923; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #3184c6; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { border-color: #ff7414; background: #ff7414; color: #21180f; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider { width: 100%; height: 1px; margin: 22px 0 17px; border: 0; background: #d9dddc; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider { background: #454c45; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-title { margin: 0 0 13px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .08em; line-height: 1.4; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features { display: grid; gap: 9px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check { flex: 0 0 13px; color: #23699a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card--featured .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__check { color: #ff8a3d; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__delivery { margin: auto 0 0; padding-top: 23px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 750; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note { max-width: 760px; margin: 20px auto 0; color: #69716e; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; padding: 44px 20px; }
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__meta { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { padding: 23px; }
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { min-height: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-pricing-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

